s make her so happy.<\/em><\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Ritu Sharma, Delhi<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_aGVzRR":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p><em>Such a cute and safe toy. The smooth finish and fun design keep my little one entertained for hours.<\/em><\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Ankit Mehra, Bangalore<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_3aeFDV":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p><em>The dance moves are adorable! My son copies the rabbit and it’s the funniest, sweetest thing to watch.<\/em><\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Snehal Patil, Mumbai<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_nkAq6j":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p><em>The lights and music are perfect for playtime. It’s compact enough to carry along on trips too.<\/em><\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Kavita Nair, Hyderabad<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_cGxwXF":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p>Totally worth it! Durable, fun, and such a lovely gift for kids.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Deepa Reddy, Chennai<\/strong><\/em>"}}},"block_order":["column_PfJECp","column_aGVzRR","column_3aeFDV","column_nkAq6j","column_cGxwXF"],"name":"Testimonials","settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","title":"💬 What Parents Are Saying","title_highlight_color":"#6d388b","heading_size":"h2","text":"","color_scheme":"background-1","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"square","column_alignment":"center","show_stars":true,"stars_color":"#ffd700","show_quotes":true,"quotes_color_scheme":"accent-2","cards_color_scheme":"bg-overlay","type":"loop","autoplay":true,"autoplay_speed":5,"arrows_color_scheme":"inverse","transparent_arrows":true,"dots_color_scheme":"inverse","desktop_full_page":false,"columns_desktop":3,"slider_desktop":true,"per_move_desktop":1,"desktop_spacing":40,"desktop_side_padding":0,"desktop_padding_calc":true,"desktop_adaptive_height":true,"desktop_dots_position":"under","desktop_arrows_position":"sides","slider_mobile":true,"enable_mobile_preview":false,"mobile_ad